abstract: >-
  Audits a SysML 1.7 to SysML v2 migration by comparing the exported v1.7
  element inventory, the migration plugin's not-migrated report, and the
  SysML v2 source text. Produces an Excel workbook of confirmed migrations,
  missed migrations, and per-metatype success rates.
  Supporting software for the doctoral praxis "Metamodel Scope Using Model-Based Decision on Intended-Use & Requirements Engineering Categorization Tool (MB-DIRECT)".
